&=-\partial_tE_z+
  \bigl(\boldsymbol\nabla\times\mathbf B\bigr)_z.\end{aligned}$ 项$F^{zz}$因反对称性而消失。令结果为零，得到 $\boldsymbol\nabla\times\mathbf B=\partial_t\mathbf E.$ 的$z$分量。通过循环指标可得$x$和$y$分量。

p.src:
Now take the time component: $\begin{aligned}\partial_\mu F^{\mu t}
&=\partial_tF^{tt}
  +\partial_xF^{xt}
  +\partial_yF^{yt}
  +\partial_zF^{zt}\\
&=\partial_xE_x+\partial_yE_y+\partial_zE_z\\
&=\boldsymbol\nabla\cdot\mathbf E.\end{aligned}$ It therefore gives Equation [eq:gauss-e-vac]. Performing the same checks on the dual tensor yields $\boldsymbol\nabla\cdot\mathbf B=0$ and $\boldsymbol\nabla\times\mathbf E=-\partial_t\mathbf B$.

